            "review_text": "Dat Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nA hidden gem in the heart of SG\nAug 2026 • Couples\nTucked away in a quiet Ho Chi Minh City alley, this cozy hidden gem feels like stepping into a seasoned traveler's private study. \n\nThe owner has poured immense effort into storytelling—every piece of vintage decor and weathered ypictures has a unique history they are eager to share. \n\nThis narrative depth extends to the inventive cocktail menu, where each drink uses local Vietnamese botanicals to capture a specific memory or local legend. With warm amber lighting and a deeply personal touch, it is an intimate refuge for anyone who appreciates a meticulously crafted drink with a story.\nRead more\nWritten August 28, 2026",
